		<Item class="Script" referent="RBX4">
			<Properties>
				<bool name="Disabled">false</bool>
				<Content name="LinkedSource"><null></null></Content>
				<string name="Name">Note to team members! |UPDATED| READ THIS</string>
				<ProtectedString name="Source">--This is the dump for BMS place contest. We put models, scripts, and ideas here. 
--Please, feel free to edit one work others have done, just make sure to copy it so you don&apos;t mess up the first.
--Were aiming for low lag, so make things highdetailed with less parts. Try to use 1 mesh insteed of 5 bricks.
--Goal for buildings- 350 bricks or less. 
--Have fun with this. Some things might not get in the end place, if it doesn&apos;t, feel free to use it in your maps :)
--Thanks! Jacob.

--Update: We have plenty of buildings now, lets get onto the props!</ProtectedString>
			</Properties>
		</Item>
